OL,3,AChris Brown given suspended eight-month
OL,4,Aprison sentence over nightclub attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Tony Baumgartner said Brown's use
OL,7,Fof the glass bottle to hit the victim
OL,8,Ftwice over the head "was plainly
OL,9,Fdangerous", adding that the violence of
OL,10,Fthe attack was "intense".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
